.SH DESCRIPTION

The
.B auto-ports-wip-checkout
command clones a work-in-progress (WIP) ports clone under
$PORTSDIR/wip, and installs the wip/wip-tools port to aid
managing the wip ports repository, and creating, [re]installing,
testing, and committing WIP ports.

The WIP ports collection contains ports that are not yet in the
main ports tree, as well as updates and modifications undergoing
testing.

.SH RETURN VALUES

0 on success, non-zero error codes otherwise.

